        "jp": "わかった。\r\nお前たちは避難するんだ。\r\n陛下は俺たちが必ず守る。",
        "official_en": "All right. You and the others evacuate yourselves. We’ll rescue His Majesty.",
        "real_en": "All right. You and the others evacuate.\r\nWe’ll protect His Majesty, no matter what."
